  "title": "SANE: Improve the way opcode is remembered for resps",
  "description": "Previous implementation kept an array that may have to\nkeep dynamically growing, and for every response there\nwas an inefficient scan of the array.\n\nInstead, maintain latest request details in conversation\nplus auth flag, then remember opcode in response frames for\nlater queries.",
