      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1749921044,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Thanks for checking, I'll merge as-is.\n\nIf you wanted to do more with request/response tracking I would add timestamp and frame-number to conversation data.  And instead of storing the frame number in the per-packet info for responses, I'd have one or more global tables with frame-number -> struct, where the struct could have the frame number and timestamp of the other req/resp, so you could link between them, show response times, indicate missing responses, etc. But only if its useful for you.",
