      "title": "SANE: Improve the way opcode is remembered for resps",
      "message": "SANE: Improve the way opcode is remembered for resps\n\nPrevious implementation kept an array that may have to\nkeep dynamically growing, and for every response there\nwas an inefficient scan of the array.\n\nInstead, maintain single opcode in conversation + auth\nflag, then remember opcode in response frames for\nlater queries.\n",
